<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH SKODA AUTO DETAILS 1996 RESULTS.</title>
<headline>CZECH SKODA AUTO DETAILS 1996 RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech car maker Skoda Automobilova a.s., a unit of Germany's Volkswagen AG, on Thursday detailed its audited financial results for 1996.</p>
<p>Results for year ending December 31, 1996: (in millions of crowns)  Net result		   163 profit vs     1,621 loss</p>
<p> Total sales	     58,898	  vs    43,945</p>
<p> Added value		8,844	  vs     5,751</p>
<p> Personnel costs	  3,820	  vs     2,988</p>
<p> Depreciation	     3,573	  vs     3,604</p>
</text>
